    "All models run locally on Apple Silicon — your recordings never leave your Mac. You can optionally route Think AI to OpenAI's or Anthropic's most capable model below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有模型都在 Apple Silicon 本机运行 — 你的录制绝不会离开 Mac。你也可以在下方将思考 AI 路由到 OpenAI 或 Anthropic 的最强模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
