            "value": "转写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcript still processing — speech appears when it's done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transkript wird noch verarbeitet – Gesprochenes erscheint, sobald es fertig ist."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La transcripción aún se está procesando; el habla aparecerá cuando termine."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription en cours – les paroles apparaîtront une fois terminée."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trascrizione ancora in elaborazione: il parlato apparirà al termine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写仍在处理 — 完成后会显示语音内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcript streams in as you speak and is ready the moment the recording stops. Keeps the transcription model in memory during recording (~2 GB) — turn off on Macs with less than 16 GB if recordings stutter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话时实时生成转写，录制停止即就绪。录制期间会将转写模型保留在内存中（约 2 GB）；如果录制卡顿，内存小于 16 GB 的 Mac 建议关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
